WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.364
Today is the third pair, and then a story.

2
00:00:02.814 --> 00:00:04.430
These are today's two pages.

3
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.606
Here is the pair. Two letters, and this one sound.

4
00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:11.272
It is the long sound from day four.

5
00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:15.674
The word is boat.

6
00:00:19.711 --> 00:00:20.727
The word is soap.

7
00:00:21.627 --> 00:00:23.819
Read the six words of job one together.

8
00:00:24.269 --> 00:00:29.028
Then your child reads the three sentences of job two alone, pointing to each word.

9
00:00:29.478 --> 00:00:34.337
There are three small words you tell your child. They are in the grown-up pages at the front.

10
00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:38.908
Then turn to the story. It uses the silent e and the pairs together.

11
00:00:39.358 --> 00:00:42.053
The pictures are at the bottom, for after the reading.

12
00:00:42.503 --> 00:00:45.988
Let your child read it to you. Then to someone else in the family.
